{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"gruvbox-warm","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Gruvbox Warm","description":"Retro groove colors, warm and easy on the eyes.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Gruvbox Warm","path":"themes/gruvbox-warm.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/gruvbox-warm.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Gruvbox Warm\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#282828\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#ebdbb2\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#1d2021\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#1d2021\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#1d2021\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#1d2021\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#3c3836\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#504945\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#3c3836\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#1d2021\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#1d2021\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#fabd2f\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#fabd2f\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#fabd2f\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#504945\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#3c383680\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#fabd2f\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#1d2021\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#fb4934\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#b8bb26\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#fabd2f\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#fb4934\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#928374\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#b8bb26\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#d3869b\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#fb4934\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#fabd2f\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#b8bb26\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#d3869b\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#83a598\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#fb4934\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#fabd2f\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#fe8019\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Gruvbox Warm\n\nRetro groove colors, warm and easy on the eyes.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Gruvbox Warm** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nColors from the Gruvbox palette by Pavel Pertsev (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#282828` |\n| Text | `#ebdbb2` |\n| Accent | `#fabd2f` |\n| Keywords | `#fb4934` |\n| Strings | `#b8bb26` |\n| Functions | `#b8bb26` |\n| Types | `#fabd2f` |\n| Comments | `#928374` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}